This is a repo to build a tool for Sarah and myself.

It will be a wrapper around yt-dlp.
it will need to run on mac
it will need to be a gui
it will need to be updateable (the app itself and the underlying youtube tool)
it should let the user plug in a single youtube link, list of links in text or a youtube channel or subscription or playlist
it should let the user download video or mp3
it should allow allowing the user to pick names/conventions
It should have pinned versions